WEBVTT

00:00:00.390 --> 00:00:03.600
I'm definitely gonna be the first-star idol!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.560
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:09.730 --> 00:00:11.910
So far on Aikatsu Stars!

00:00:11.910 --> 00:00:16.450
I'm a second-year at the idol middle school, Four Star Academy.

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:20.970
As one of the top idols of S4, I work hard at Aikatsu every day.

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:24.870
Elza-san's mother came to visit Japan.

00:00:24.870 --> 00:00:29.500
She was incredibly beautiful and graceful, as befitting a former top idol.

00:00:29.830 --> 00:00:34.790
That night, Elza-san and her mother held a party at Venus Ark.

00:00:34.790 --> 00:00:38.970
It allowed me to renew my vows while gazing up at the stars.

00:00:38.970 --> 00:00:42.640
My dream is to become the world's brightest star—

00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:45.650
The star shining brightest in the sky.

00:00:46.420 --> 00:00:50.910
Today, I'm going to do my best Aikatsu and make my way toward my dream.{mezashite standard is toward}{thanks for doing something, this line just washed over me}

00:00:52.040 --> 00:00:54.950
Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:00.330
What do you think?

00:01:00.330 --> 00:01:02.490
That was perfect, Koharu-chan!

00:01:03.700 --> 00:01:07.370
It's still hard to believe one of my dreams is about to come true.

00:01:07.370 --> 00:01:09.570
And mine too, Yume-chan.

00:01:10.560 --> 00:01:15.020
I'll be standing alongside you 
on stage in dresses I designed.

00:01:15.020 --> 00:01:19.220
I've wished for this even since before I left for Italy.

00:01:19.220 --> 00:01:21.740
Both of our dreams will be coming true at once. {YEAH NO SHIT}

00:01:21.740 --> 00:01:22.970
Yeah.

00:01:23.770 --> 00:01:25.870
Make sure it to keep it a secret, though.

00:01:25.870 --> 00:01:30.000
Don't let anyone know about our grab-bag plan to surprise everyone at the end of the party.

00:01:30.510 --> 00:01:32.610
There's trouble!

00:01:34.870 --> 00:01:36.540
Have you heard?

00:01:36.540 --> 00:01:38.350
It's about Halloween!

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:17.340
Forgive me! It's all my fault.

00:03:19.300 --> 00:03:22.530
An apology isn't going to fix anything at this point.

00:03:22.530 --> 00:03:26.640
Is there no way around holding a combined event with Venus Ark?

00:03:26.640 --> 00:03:34.900
There isn't. My error was to visit Venus Ark last night in an attempt to deepen our relationship.

00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:41.400
Indeed, every single one of our students is hard at work preparing for Halloween.

00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:43.870
I see, for Halloween.

00:03:45.120 --> 00:03:49.230
It is my understanding that Japan's festivities are rather shallow.

00:03:49.230 --> 00:03:55.250
If you would like, we invite you to partake in 
Venus Ark's Halloween as an educational opportunity.

00:03:57.130 --> 00:03:58.670
I refuse.

00:03:58.670 --> 00:03:59.790
Why?

00:03:59.790 --> 00:04:04.310
Because I would rather invite <i>you</i> to participate in our Halloween Night.

00:04:04.310 --> 00:04:08.570
Only if you can promise not to cry in fright, of course.

00:04:14.270 --> 00:04:15.940
I'm truly sorry.

00:04:15.940 --> 00:04:18.080
Don't worry, Headmaster!

00:04:18.080 --> 00:04:22.220
We'll all work together to give Elza-san and their idols a scare!

00:04:22.220 --> 00:04:24.070
I'm with Yume-chan!

00:04:24.070 --> 00:04:28.450
As am I. The pride of Four Star Academy is at stake!

00:04:28.450 --> 00:04:29.730
We'll have to hurry.

00:04:29.730 --> 00:04:31.470
Let's get prepping!

00:04:31.470 --> 00:04:33.210
Yeah!

00:04:33.210 --> 00:04:39.210
<i>Nikaidou is a given, but the rest of S4 have really grown into their positions.</i>

00:04:39.910 --> 00:04:41.340
<i>Thank you.</i>

00:04:42.220 --> 00:04:46.220
What are we supposed to do now, Yume-chan?

00:04:46.220 --> 00:04:53.050
It'll be okay. They said there'll be a big party at the end, so we can go ahead with the grab-bag plan there.

00:04:53.050 --> 00:04:54.700
Thank goodness.

00:04:54.700 --> 00:04:55.760
Yume!

00:04:56.350 --> 00:04:59.360
Every student has received the memo!

00:04:59.360 --> 00:05:03.740
I asked Nii-san to get M4 in on the event too.

00:05:03.740 --> 00:05:08.530
Great! Now we just wait for night to come.

00:05:12.650 --> 00:05:16.290
Welcome to Four Star Academy's Halloween Night.

00:05:16.290 --> 00:05:22.050
Venus Ark students will traverse a set course and gather candy at each stop.

00:05:22.050 --> 00:05:24.720
You win if you can make it to the end.

00:05:24.720 --> 00:05:29.470
However, you will be disqualified if you get too scared along the way.

00:05:29.470 --> 00:05:32.600
How will you be measuring fear?

00:05:32.600 --> 00:05:36.480
With the Aikatsu Mobiles you left with us earlier.

00:05:37.000 --> 00:05:40.480
We have installed a special program on them.{we could just use program and it would be less painful}{I originally had but figured this would sound more better}

00:05:43.810 --> 00:05:44.990
I see.

00:05:44.990 --> 00:05:47.740
I'm so excited to for Four Star Halloween!

00:05:47.740 --> 00:05:51.120
But if you don't scare me, then baa!

00:05:51.430 --> 00:05:52.620
It's about time to begin.

00:05:52.620 --> 00:05:56.960
Before we do, may I set a condition?

00:05:56.960 --> 00:05:58.250
That being?

00:05:58.250 --> 00:06:03.300
Whoever wins will have the right to hold the closing party as they like.

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:05.630
And what do you have in mind?

00:06:05.980 --> 00:06:07.630
These things!

00:06:07.630 --> 00:06:12.140
All the students at Four Star will have to wear them!

00:06:12.140 --> 00:06:14.340
Well, doesn't that sound intriguing.

00:06:14.340 --> 00:06:18.520
Four Star Academy's party will be buried in pumpkins.

00:06:18.840 --> 00:06:20.710
<i>But if that happens...</i>

00:06:20.710 --> 00:06:22.650
<i>Our performance...</i>

00:06:28.780 --> 00:06:33.050
I trust in the students of my academy.

00:06:33.050 --> 00:06:34.700
We accept your challenge.

00:06:36.760 --> 00:06:38.830
Splendid.

00:06:38.830 --> 00:06:46.210
Now then, let Halloween Night: 
Four Star Academy vs. Venus Ark begin!

00:06:47.440 --> 00:06:49.180
Okay, everyone!

00:06:49.180 --> 00:06:50.820
Are you ready?

00:06:50.820 --> 00:06:52.620
Yes, we're good.

00:06:52.620 --> 00:06:56.060
As the French philosopher Pascal once said, {I didn't know he was also a philosopher?}{have you never heard of pascal's wager}

00:06:56.060 --> 00:07:02.150
“Fear not, provided you fear; but if you fear not, then fear."

00:07:02.820 --> 00:07:06.770
Let us believe that those of Venus Ark know fear. {right?}{sure}

00:07:06.770 --> 00:07:08.110
Girls!

00:07:08.610 --> 00:07:12.490
I brought the candy. This year we've got a variety of gummies.

00:07:15.520 --> 00:07:20.000
Song Gummy, Theater Gummy, 
Beauty Gummy, and Dance Gummy. {there's no way to do this. prove me wrong}{this is the way to do this}

00:07:23.410 --> 00:07:24.750
It's yummy!

00:07:25.080 --> 00:07:29.760
Hurry, the Venus Ark students should be appearing momentarily.

00:07:30.180 --> 00:07:35.010
Let's scare their pants off with the power of the Adminz! {I had thought to change this to make it more obvious it was a silly name}{I like this}

00:07:37.550 --> 00:07:38.390
A blackout?

00:07:46.910 --> 00:07:49.690
We have come for your lives!

00:07:51.190 --> 00:07:53.200
This isn't felicitous!

00:07:59.200 --> 00:08:02.710
Burn... burn-taiyaki...{uh}

00:08:02.710 --> 00:08:06.710
I cannot... handle... the heat...

00:08:07.850 --> 00:08:09.390
How childish.

00:08:09.390 --> 00:08:14.380
It seems it was a good idea to bring the Elzacise virtual machine from the ship.

00:08:15.590 --> 00:08:17.240
What, that's it?

00:08:17.240 --> 00:08:21.010
It's no fun if Kirara doesn't get to do anything!

00:08:21.010 --> 00:08:23.230
My, what a disappointment.

00:08:26.440 --> 00:08:31.530
Now we'll take the candy as proof of our conquest.

00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:34.240
H-Hold it right there!

00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:38.870
The Adminz will never fall!

00:08:39.760 --> 00:08:40.870
It's me?!

00:08:51.510 --> 00:08:53.620
Congratulations.

00:08:53.620 --> 00:08:56.260
I've taken you down with me.

00:08:56.620 --> 00:08:59.260
It can't be!

00:08:59.260 --> 00:09:01.610
This is Dancing Ninja.

00:09:01.610 --> 00:09:03.740
I repeat, Dancing Ninja.

00:09:03.740 --> 00:09:05.100
Come in.

00:09:05.100 --> 00:09:08.090
What?! The Adminz were defeated?!

00:09:08.790 --> 00:09:12.770
No, they did well enough removing one of them.

00:09:12.770 --> 00:09:14.360
I await further reports.

00:09:14.360 --> 00:09:17.190
They got past Rola's group?

00:09:17.190 --> 00:09:22.260
Don't worry, Koharu-chan. Ako-chan and Theater Class still stand in their way.

00:09:22.260 --> 00:09:24.370
Right, Ako-chan can stop them!

00:09:24.370 --> 00:09:28.210
Yeah, I know they'll be able to give Elza-san a fright!

00:09:52.150 --> 00:09:54.780
Looks like this is ours.

00:09:54.780 --> 00:09:55.900
Stop right there!

00:09:56.900 --> 00:09:58.320
Ako-chan's up!

00:09:58.320 --> 00:10:02.330
I swear on the pride of Theater Class and S4!

00:10:03.330 --> 00:10:06.250
I expected you to say that!

00:10:08.120 --> 00:10:09.460
Here, here!

00:10:12.500 --> 00:10:14.130
Come this way!

00:10:17.510 --> 00:10:19.430
We should get moving.

00:10:19.430 --> 00:10:20.300
Sure.

00:10:21.140 --> 00:10:23.470
Theater Class's been defeated?!

00:10:23.470 --> 00:10:27.890
At least we have the silver lining of Hanazono Kirara being delayed.

00:10:27.890 --> 00:10:32.570
Headmaster, I need to head to the last stop in Song Class's lesson room.

00:10:32.570 --> 00:10:33.440
Go on.

00:10:34.280 --> 00:10:35.570
Yume-chan!

00:10:36.190 --> 00:10:40.570
Just as insurance. They still have to get past Beauty Class before us.

00:10:41.910 --> 00:10:43.030
See you later.

00:10:46.330 --> 00:10:50.000
<i>Please, Mahiru-chan. Stop Venus Ark!</i>

00:11:11.520 --> 00:11:17.190
Mahiru-chan is engaged in a fierce duel with Kizaki Rei-chan, over.

00:11:17.190 --> 00:11:18.900
Excellent job.

00:11:18.900 --> 00:11:21.950
All that's left is Elza Forte and a handful of students.

00:11:21.950 --> 00:11:25.950
Their next checkpoint is at the gym with M4.

00:11:26.740 --> 00:11:31.710
Good. M4 will bring Elza Forte to her knees with their charm!

00:11:33.710 --> 00:11:36.130
Hey, where were we supposed to go again?

00:11:36.130 --> 00:11:38.380
We should've asked them earlier.

00:11:50.100 --> 00:11:51.890
A real fairy?!

00:11:51.890 --> 00:11:54.650
No way! That's scientifically impossible!

00:11:57.570 --> 00:12:00.530
Oh? To whom do I owe the pleasure?

00:12:03.160 --> 00:12:04.530
W-We're—

00:12:04.530 --> 00:12:06.780
I am Igarashi Nozomu.

00:12:07.330 --> 00:12:11.040
Everyone's idol, the prince of the M4 Kingdom.

00:12:11.040 --> 00:12:15.920
My! I've never met a male idol before!

00:12:21.800 --> 00:12:23.760
So, Elza-sama...

00:12:24.590 --> 00:12:28.430
Leave them be. In any case, have you procured the gymnasium's candy?

00:12:28.430 --> 00:12:29.930
Yes, right here!

00:12:29.930 --> 00:12:33.060
We have only one stop left now.

00:12:33.560 --> 00:12:37.480
What?! M4 was charmed by Futaba Aria?!

00:12:37.480 --> 00:12:39.070
What of Elza Forte?

00:12:39.980 --> 00:12:42.150
She's nearing the last stop?

00:12:44.740 --> 00:12:46.570
Nanakura! Where are you going?!

00:12:47.120 --> 00:12:49.370
To protect our dream!

00:12:53.660 --> 00:12:58.840
Four Star Academy's Halloween was as trivial as I expected.

00:13:12.470 --> 00:13:13.600
An octopus?

00:13:13.600 --> 00:13:17.900
N-No! I'm the legendary sea monster, kraken!

00:13:17.900 --> 00:13:18.980
Take this!

00:13:20.070 --> 00:13:21.440
Aikatsu!

00:13:21.440 --> 00:13:22.990
Aikatsu!

00:13:25.740 --> 00:13:27.200
It's a giant octopus!

00:13:27.200 --> 00:13:28.950
The Devil's familiar!

00:13:31.410 --> 00:13:34.660
There! You two are out!

00:13:34.660 --> 00:13:38.880
In the West, octopuses are despised as the Devil's familiars.

00:13:38.880 --> 00:13:41.130
I'm impressed you are so informed.

00:13:41.130 --> 00:13:43.670
No, I just said I was a kraken.

00:13:43.670 --> 00:13:45.420
If you call yourself an octopus,

00:13:46.090 --> 00:13:50.050
then I am Captain Elza, bane of demons of the deep!

00:14:03.110 --> 00:14:04.190
Alice-chan!

00:14:04.530 --> 00:14:07.200
I-I can't move!

00:14:07.200 --> 00:14:11.240
Too bad. Everything belongs to Perfect Elza.

00:14:11.240 --> 00:14:14.580
Both the candy and the closing party.

00:14:16.790 --> 00:14:18.370
<i>If it was me...</i>

00:14:18.790 --> 00:14:24.380
<i>I would want to sing together with my dear childhood friend.</i>

00:14:24.760 --> 00:14:30.720
<i>Because I've always wanted to perform with Koharu-chan, and I still do!</i>

00:14:31.430 --> 00:14:34.350
Our dream...

00:14:34.350 --> 00:14:37.350
I'll be taking the candy now.

00:14:47.280 --> 00:14:48.530
Hard candy?

00:14:48.530 --> 00:14:52.120
And they're individually wrapped so you can eat them later.

00:14:53.370 --> 00:14:55.790
Oh dear, I shall be too late! {I hope my online reference is right}{I'll trust you on}

00:14:57.120 --> 00:15:00.000
Did you think this would be enough to stop me?

00:15:01.040 --> 00:15:02.210
How sweet.{I guess this is fine}

00:15:05.880 --> 00:15:07.550
Koharu Nanakura!

00:15:12.930 --> 00:15:14.260
Alice Carroll?

00:15:15.470 --> 00:15:17.770
Did I surprise you, Elza-san?

00:15:17.770 --> 00:15:21.980
Unfortunately not. Did you honestly think it would?

00:15:21.980 --> 00:15:25.940
No, but the next thing we'll show you will.

00:15:25.940 --> 00:15:29.440
Yume-chan, let's change our plan a bit.

00:15:29.440 --> 00:15:34.450
Okay! We'll show Elza-san just how bright our dream is!

00:15:34.450 --> 00:15:36.330
How did it turn out?

00:15:36.330 --> 00:15:37.830
Wait, Koharu?!

00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:39.960
Why are you here?

00:15:39.960 --> 00:15:45.960
Watch us, everyone! Yume-chan and I have a grab-bag surprise for you!{this could either way but since}

00:15:50.880 --> 00:15:55.300
This is why you designed these Rainbow Berry Parfait dresses.

00:15:58.770 --> 00:16:03.310
We've always had the same dream, shining like a prismatic rainbow.

00:16:06.770 --> 00:16:09.360
Let's cross the seven-colored rainbow together!

00:16:09.360 --> 00:16:11.820
And see what lies beyond!

00:16:12.740 --> 00:16:13.950
Nijino Yume!

00:16:14.820 --> 00:16:16.330
Nanakura Koharu!

00:16:16.330 --> 00:16:18.330
Ready to go!

00:19:57.460 --> 00:20:00.090
Their performance was awesome!

00:20:00.090 --> 00:20:05.720
I have been absolutely stunned by the glow of their rainbow!

00:20:07.180 --> 00:20:09.720
They brought tears to my eyes!

00:20:09.720 --> 00:20:12.310
That was great, Koharu and Yume!

00:20:12.310 --> 00:20:14.980
Yes, they completely surprised me.

00:20:19.990 --> 00:20:23.700
Huh? Elza-san's the only person who wasn't stirred at all.

00:20:24.240 --> 00:20:25.490
That means...

00:20:28.540 --> 00:20:30.200
I accept my loss.

00:20:31.370 --> 00:20:36.210
However, it was not to Four Star Academy, but to Koharu Nanakura.

00:20:37.380 --> 00:20:42.050
I expected no less from the talent I discovered.

00:20:42.050 --> 00:20:45.180
You two understood each other to an extraordinary extent.

00:20:47.140 --> 00:20:48.260
Elza-san.

00:20:49.680 --> 00:20:51.140
Thank you!

00:20:59.360 --> 00:21:01.030
Okay, everyone!{how nice of them to typeset the sign for you}

00:21:01.030 --> 00:21:05.910
Let's let loose with a party and deepen our bonds!

00:21:05.910 --> 00:21:07.030
Thank you!

00:21:07.490 --> 00:21:08.910
Cheers!

00:21:11.200 --> 00:21:14.080
Hey, why don't the two of us make a unit? {which would literally be the first unit in the entire series}

00:21:14.080 --> 00:21:16.920
I like the sound of that! Congratulation!

00:21:20.590 --> 00:21:21.960
I brought this for you.

00:21:21.960 --> 00:21:24.420
Oh, thank you.

00:21:24.420 --> 00:21:26.680
What's going on with Nozomu?

00:21:26.680 --> 00:21:28.930
Just let him have this one.

00:21:30.060 --> 00:21:33.430
I wanted to see Koharu-chan perform too!

00:21:33.430 --> 00:21:35.520
What a mess.

00:21:39.770 --> 00:21:42.150
I need to apologize, Elza.

00:21:42.150 --> 00:21:45.450
It's fine. This was simply a game.

00:21:46.820 --> 00:21:50.200
<i>But the fun and games end here.</i>

00:21:50.950 --> 00:21:53.200
You were great today, Koharu!

00:21:54.330 --> 00:21:55.710
Your hard work paid off.

00:21:55.710 --> 00:21:59.710
I-It's supposed to be my job to praise Koharu!

00:21:59.710 --> 00:22:06.720
Everyone please gather for a show by 
tonight's MVPs, Nijino Yume and Nanakura Koharu.

00:22:07.760 --> 00:22:09.390
Another one?

00:22:09.390 --> 00:22:11.430
Why not? Do as many as you'd like.

00:22:11.430 --> 00:22:13.930
It was your dream for so long.

00:22:13.930 --> 00:22:15.140
We want to see as well.

00:22:17.690 --> 00:22:19.400
Let's do it, Koharu-chan!

00:22:22.360 --> 00:22:23.280
Sure!

00:23:56.120 --> 00:23:59.750
Koharu-chan designed the Purple Couleur Ribbon Coord.

00:23:59.750 --> 00:24:03.630
The seven-colored rainbow is unforgettable and perfect for our brand.

00:24:03.630 --> 00:24:07.960
I feel like I can do even better Aikatsu with you by my side, Yume-chan.

00:24:07.960 --> 00:24:10.050
Let's do our best!

00:24:10.880 --> 00:24:13.470
Only one pair of Star Wings remains.

00:24:13.470 --> 00:24:16.890
Elza, a fire has been lit in my heart at last.

00:24:16.890 --> 00:24:19.430
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:19.430 --> 00:24:20.930
Kizaki Rei's Oath.

00:24:20.930 --> 00:24:22.980
Become the first-star idol!
